    <Folder>
      <name>EPark Zones</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>1001</name>
        <description><![CDATA[18 Stalls<br>Rate: $2.00 / HR M to F; $1.00 / HR Sat to Sun <br>2 Hours Max<br><br>Hours of Operation<br>08:00 to 21:00 M to Sat<br>10:00 to 17:00 Sun                                                       <br><br><br>How to pay for parking?<br>Scanning QR codes<br>Pay online on the parking: webpage: https://hotspotparking.com/users/products/edmontonparking <br>Download Hotspot Parking Transit Taxis app through Google Play or Apple Store. Create an account and pay through the app.<br>Create a HotSpot account online and link a payment card to pay through phone: 1-855-712-5888 ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#poly-4186F0-605-255</styleUrl>
        <Polygon>
          <outerBoundaryIs>
            <LinearRing>
              <tessellate>1</tessellate>
              <coordinates>
                -113.4867511,53.5459323,0
                -113.4867226,53.5458768,0
                -113.4841373,53.5463249,0
                -113.4841696,53.5463762,0
                -113.4867511,53.5459323,0
              </coordinates>
            </LinearRing>
          </outerBoundaryIs>
        </Polygon>
      </Placemark>
