        <name>7000 - City Hall PARKADE </name>
        <description><![CDATA[Rates:<br>Weekday: Monday to Friday<br>$5.00/hr (Max $20) - 8:00 am to 6:00 pm<br>$5.00/hr (Max $15) - 6:00 pm to 12:00 am<br><br>Weekend: Saturday and Sunday<br>$2.00/hr (Max $10) - 8:00 am to 6:00 pm<br>$2.00/hr (Max $10) - 6:00 pm to 12:00 am<br><br>Statutory Holidays: Free<br><br>Payment Options: Cash, Visa, Mastercard, and Amex<br><br>More Information:<br>Change machines located in parking Levels P1 and P3 elevator lobbies<br>Bright and secured<br>Access to Churchill LRT Station and Pedway<br><br>Max Height Clearance -<br>P1 and P2 - 8' 5" or 2.56 meters<br>P3, P4 and P5 - 6' 10" or 2.08 meters<br><br>5 Accessible Stalls<br>161 Stalls<br><br>How to pay for parking?<br>Scanning QR codes<br>Pay online on the parking: webpage: https://hotspotparking.com/users/products/edmontonparking <br>Download Hotspot Parking Transit Taxis app through Google Play or Apple Store. Create an account and pay through the app.<br>Create a HotSpot account online and link a payment card to pay through phone: 1-855-712-5888]]></description>
